- Package 134 (GitLab 9d8ad319) carries ES02 0.163.0 = the machine's tools 0136 /
  0137 / 0145 / 0147 / 0149 / 0150 taken in; its code is byte-for-byte the machine at
  5e6aacc (tools 0150), so the three-way base is 5e6aacc (not base_45670f61). Taken:
  version 0.163.0 + its CHANGELOG / HANDOVER / WPF_DIFF_LOG entries (HANDOVER: one
  conflict -- ES02 dropped the §5 package history; the machine's kept). Kept: the
  machine's tools 0151-0162 and its tests -- ES02's run_tests.js / smoke_extension.js
  had dropped tools 0143's worktrees test and lnCutPages (0143 not taken there).
- EastSun 1005: "claude 在上 C++ 檔案顯示在下 你有全部加進外掛工具嗎? 怎別台電腦沒有":
  the three layout settings lived only in this PC's user settings. Hub.applyLayout sets
  them on any PC, once (globalState htd.layout1), at the user level, each only when the
  user has not set it: workbench.editor.editorActionsLocation = titleBar,
  workbench.editor.pinnedTabsOnSeparateRow = true, debug.toolBarLocation = hidden.
  ht9045Designer.layout.apply = false: never.

Tests: run_all 3/3 layers (extension 237: the layout set once, the user's own kept,
off by setting); real VS Code 153/159 (3 known stale + the BtnPanelLane3 set, as before).

